By whatever rules out "it is not the case that Obama is in my garden" or "i=
t is not the case that chlorine is in my garden" from being true in a circu=
mstance in which some (but not all) Obama/chlorine is in my garden. I suppo=
se the principle is that referents are treated as atoms rather than as comp=
lexes some bits of which do broda and other bits of which don't necessarily=
